        curatorTitle: "A Vision of the End",
        curatorNote: "The scale of this book is baffling—spanning millions of years and multiple dimensions. It represents the original conclusion to the trilogy, questioning the very nature of life in the universe.<br><br><strong>Remembrance of Earth's Past Series:</strong><br>• <a href='/book/the-three-body-problem-cixin-liu/'>The Three-Body Problem</a> (Book 1)<br>• <a href='/book/the-dark-forest-cixin-liu/'>The Dark Forest</a> (Book 2)<br>• <a href='/book/deaths-end-cixin-liu/'>Death's End</a> (Book 3)<br>• <a href='/book/the-redemption-of-time-baoshu/'>The Redemption of Time</a> (Book 4)",
